ne-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260620/202606200652421747_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260620/202606200652421747_720.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【世界杯战报】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-20/match1867426date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">提前出线！美国2-0澳大利亚两连胜领跑 巴洛贡造乌龙弗里曼破门</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260620/zhanbao_image_1867426_1781901696_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260620/zhanbao_image_1867426_1781901696_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260620/zhanbao_image_1867426_1781901696_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>巴洛贡造乌龙球，弗里曼破门，最终美国2-0击败澳大利亚，已经提前确定小组出线，澳大利亚积3分排名小组第二。</p><p><strong>【世界杯数据】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-20/6a3582b79d642native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">提前小组出线！美国连续2届晋级世界杯淘汰赛 近4次参赛全部出线</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260620/6a35b0734b734.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260620/6a35b0734b734.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260620/6a35b0734b734.jpg"> </div><p>美加墨世界杯D组第二轮，美国队战胜澳大利亚，提前1轮小组出线！</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-20/6a3586185660anative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">世界杯D组积分榜：美国2-0澳大利亚提前出线，11点土耳其vs巴拉圭</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-20/6a35aa3e96a7bnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">本届世界杯东道主战绩：美、墨提前出线，加拿大领跑小组出线在望</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260619/6a34ad8ea3daa.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260619/6a34ad8ea3daa.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260619/6a34ad8ea3daa.jpg"> </div><p>本届世界杯由美国、加拿大、墨西哥共同举办，三支东道主目前为止在本届赛事中都进展顺利。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-20/6a35b276a0db2native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">后劲不足！澳大利亚不敌美国，世界杯亚足联球队6场不败后遭6连败</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260620/202606200520286490.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260620/202606200520286490_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260620/202606200520286490_720.jpg"> </div><p>在第一轮小组赛中，亚足联球队一度保持2胜4平6场不败，但自伊拉克1-4负于挪威起，到如今的澳大利亚0-2美国，亚足联球队已经遭遇6连败。</p><p><strong>【若昂·内维斯谈C罗言论引争议】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-19/6a356288eca11native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">RMC：葡萄牙中场若昂·内维斯和女友社媒被冲，女友被迫关闭评论</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.21" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260619/202606192349376267.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.21" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.21" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260619/202606192349376267.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260619/202606192349376267.jpg"> </div><p>据RMC报道，C罗事件持续引发热议，他的队友若昂·内维斯却因为一句关于C罗的简短评论而引发了网友对他及其伴侣在社交媒体上的大量仇恨言论和信息。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-20/6a35730391032native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">鲁本·迪亚斯：C罗是众人关注的焦点 但我认为我们所有人都有责任</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.63" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260620/202606200209552091.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.63" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.63" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260620/202606200209552091.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260620/202606200209552091.jpg"> </div><p>葡萄牙中后卫鲁本·迪亚斯出席新闻发布会，被问到了诸多话题。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-20/6a3568e4d4872native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">B费妻子社媒也遭刷屏：让你丈夫给C罗传球！尊重足坛历史最佳</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.29" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260620/202606200112139455_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.29" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.29" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260620/202606200112139455_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260620/202606200112139455_720.jpg"> </div><p>在B费、维蒂尼亚等多名葡萄牙球员社媒被刷屏后，B费妻子社媒也被球迷占领。大量网友在她最新一条社媒评论区留言。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-20/6a3578d0aa2bfnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">C罗姐姐：葡萄牙队像中了邪一样，忘了怎么传球、抢球和反击</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260620/202606200115221002.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260620/202606200115221002_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260620/202606200115221002_720.jpg"> </div><p>葡萄牙1-1遭民主刚果逼平，C罗姐姐卡蒂娅发文批评了葡萄牙队的表现。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-20/6a359ab322e28native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">罗腾谈内维斯：没理解他赛后谈C罗的采访 他犯了沟通上的小错误</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-20/6a35a7d655a6bnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">次轮将战乌兹别克斯坦！C罗晒训练合照，配文：永远团结！</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.55" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260620/202606200440006224_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.55" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.55" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260620/202606200440006224_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duo